BINARIES
  A debian package is available https://github.com/MilanSkocic/txt2latex/releases.

SOURCES
  A Makefile is provided for installing the script and its man page.

      $ ./configure 
      $ make 
      $ make install

  You can change the installation path by setting the prefix as shown 
  in the example below where the installation will be system-wide.
  By default prefix=$HOME/.local.

      $ make
      $ make install prefix=/usr/local

